, when she's with Hiroto, she sometimes uses her tail to express how she feels... By hitting him with it!"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74994"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96b7c2b04474b10fa576f8cfc9053c06bb04849cca2e0e5d41a896bc37cf94ed.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b791967332531f13db44eda0bbb86a2f793cdb1ebd244d874b4ab97d9985965c.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"渕上 舞","creatorId":"vndb:s9717","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9717","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9717","name":"渕上 舞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:66395","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"정 혜원","creatorId":"vndb:s17943","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17943","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17943","name":"정 혜원","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:66397","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c74995","characterName":"ぺた子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c74995"},"originalCharacterName":"ぺた子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A bright and outgoing girl with a memory system that's basically degraded to that of a fish. Really, she can barely even remember what happened the day before. More research is needed to determine if this is normal part of being a mermaid. It doesn't seem to hold her back any though, she lives her life to its fullest."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74995"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e8d5a0f2027de69b